# ^LicenseText
Fadlan dib u eeg heshiiska shatiga ka hor intaadan rakibin $(^NameDA). Haddii aad aqbasho dhammaan shuruudaha heshiiska, guji Waan aqbalay.
# ^LicenseTextCB
Fadlan dib u eeg heshiiska shatiga ka hor intaadan rakibin $(^NameDA). Haddii aad aqbasho dhammaan shuruudaha heshiiska, calaamadee sanduuqa hoose. $_CLICK
# ^LicenseTextRB
Fadlan dib u eeg heshiiska shatiga ka hor intaadan rakibin $(^NameDA). Haddii aad aqbasho dhammaan shuruudaha heshiiska, dooro doorashada koowaad ee hoose. $_CLICK
# ^UnLicenseText
Fadlan dib u eeg heshiiska shatiga ka hor intaadan ka saarin $(^NameDA). Haddii aad aqbasho dhammaan shuruudaha heshiiska, guji Waan aqbalay.
# ^UnLicenseTextCB
Fadlan dib u eeg heshiiska shatiga ka hor intaadan ka saarin $(^NameDA). Haddii aad aqbasho dhammaan shuruudaha heshiiska, calaamadee sanduuqa hoose. $_CLICK
# ^UnLicenseTextRB
Fadlan dib u eeg heshiiska shatiga ka hor intaadan ka saarin $(^NameDA). Haddii aad aqbasho dhammaan shuruudaha heshiiska, dooro doorashada koowaad ee hoose. $_CLICK
